---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const positions=[
  {
    "company": "Hearst Corporation",
    "brand": "DBA Black Book",
    "role": "Product Solutions Engineer",
    "dates": "Oct 2024 – Present",
    "location": "Massachusetts, USA",
    "domain": "Automotive intelligence · Analytics products",
    "highlights": [
      "400+ reporting assets",
      "~300 hours/year estimated effort saved",
      "40% increase in Visual Analytics adoption"
    ],
    "bullets": [
      "I'm leading the architecture and technical research for an in-house Tableau replacement: a new web-based analytics platform with its own semantic/data layer, security model, and deployment infrastructure. The goal is lower licensing costs and more control over analytics delivery.",
      "Built and deployed the BB Reporting Navigator as a production self-service product. It brings together 400+ reporting assets, 960+ lineage relationships, 3,500+ governed fields, and 20+ business metrics so teams can investigate dependencies and changes in one place.",
      "Replaced recurring report-by-report investigations with self-service downstream impact, field and metric analysis, operational paths, and change history. The estimated reduction in recurring BI investigation work is around 300 hours a year (~15% of annual working capacity).",
      "Developed and launched Visual Analytics for residual-value and vehicle-lifecycle insights. Adoption of data-driven valuation tools increased 40% among internal analysts and dealership clients."
    ]
  },
  {
    "company": "Celandyne Software Solutions LLC",
    "role": "Data Scientist",
    "dates": "May 2024 – Sep 2024",
    "location": "California, USA",
    "domain": "Recruitment technology · NLP",
    "highlights": [
      "8 stages automated",
      "Top 20 candidate ranking"
    ],
    "bullets": [
      "Built a Python-based NLP pipeline that automated eight stages of résumé-to-job matching, from PDF text extraction and preprocessing to TF-IDF and cosine similarity scoring.",
      "Used KNN-based ranking to score and shortlist the top 20 résumés for an opening, replacing manual comparisons with a repeatable workflow. The matching design targeted results under two seconds."
    ]
  },
  {
    "company": "Valor Compounding Pharmacy Inc",
    "role": "Data Analyst",
    "dates": "Jun 2022 – Feb 2024",
    "location": "California, USA",
    "domain": "Healthcare · Pharmacy operations",
    "highlights": [
      "5 data sources · 15+ KPIs",
      "30% improvement in performance metrics",
      "Missed calls: ~40% to 15%"
    ],
    "bullets": [
      "Built a role-based performance analytics system across calls, prescriptions, tickets, schedules, and employee data. Instead of judging everyone by prescription volume, it used 15+ KPIs and role-specific targets. Employee performance metrics improved 30% across Q1–Q2 2023.",
      "Looked at call patterns by hour, day, week, and month and found around 40% of peak-hour calls were missed. After expanding access to Five9 history from three months to twelve, the findings guided staffing changes that reduced missed calls to 15% (a 62.5% relative reduction) and daily Zendesk tickets from 120–150 to 40–50 (~67% reduction)."
    ]
  },
  {
    "company": "Saviant Consulting",
    "role": "Solution Engineer",
    "dates": "Apr 2019 – Jul 2021",
    "location": "Pune, India",
    "domain": "Pharmaceuticals · Cosmetics · Manufacturing",
    "highlights": [
      "45% better dashboard performance",
      "10K+ salons · 80K+ professionals"
    ],
    "engagements": [
      {
        "client": "Cencora",
        "previous": "earlier Dymaxium Inc.",
        "sector": "Pharmaceuticals",
        "bullets": [
          "Led the Tableau-to-Qlik Sense migration as the main point of contact, rebuilding dashboards, coordinating with the data engineering team, and handling reporting, access, and production issues.",
          "Optimized pharmaceutical sales reporting using Python and SQL Server. Dashboard performance improved 45%, load times dropped from 114 to 37 seconds, two-year sales projections became available, and recurring production errors fell 50%."
        ]
      },
      {
        "client": "L'Oréal India Private Ltd",
        "sector": "Cosmetics",
        "bullets": [
          "Built education and recruitment analytics covering 10K+ salons and 80K+ salon professionals. The work identified 37.8% year-over-year training growth and hiring delays: an average 59 days to offer and 99 days to join."
        ]
      },
      {
        "client": "SKF India Ltd",
        "sector": "Manufacturing",
        "bullets": [
          "Built commercial and customer analytics supporting $14B+ in year-to-date sales, combining plan variance, forecasts, regional performance, and purchase cadence to identify growth gaps and next-buy opportunities."
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "company": "Techknomatic Services Pvt. Ltd",
    "role": "Technology Analyst",
    "dates": "Aug 2017 – Apr 2019",
    "location": "Pune, India",
    "domain": "Petrochemicals · Workforce analytics",
    "highlights": [
      "6 reporting automation projects",
      "Overtime: 24% to 5%"
    ],
    "engagements": [
      {
        "client": "Honeywell Automation India Ltd",
        "sector": "Petrochemicals",
        "bullets": [
          "Delivered six Salesforce reporting automation projects and SSRS workforce analytics solutions. Reporting accuracy improved 25%, and overtime fell from 24% to 5% through workflow automation and labor-capacity analysis."
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
];

---
<BaseLayout title="Experience | Bhagyashri Patil">
<header class="page-intro">
  <p class="margin-note">The work, so far.</p>
  <span class="eyebrow">Experience</span>
  <h1>Different industries.<br/><span class="accent">Similar questions.</span></h1>
  <p>From pharmacy teams to automotive analytics, I've spent over seven years figuring out where information gets stuck and building tools people can actually use. These are the roles and projects behind that work.</p>
  <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="#career">Jump to experience ↘</a><a class="button secondary" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/bhagyashripatil/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a></div>
</header>
<section class="section" id="career" aria-labelledby="career-title">
  <div class="section-row">
    <span class="eyebrow">01 / Career journey</span>
    <div><h2 id="career-title">What I've been working on.</h2><p>A few selected contributions, from the work itself to what changed for the people using it.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="timeline">
    {positions.map((job,i)=><article class="role-card">
      <div class="role-side"><span class="role-index">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><span class="role-date">{job.dates}</span><span class="role-location">{job.location}</span></div>
      <div class="role-detail">
        <span class="eyebrow">{job.domain}</span>
        <h3>{job.company}</h3>
        {job.brand && <span class="company-brand">{job.brand}</span>}
        <p class="role-title">{job.role}</p>
        <div class="outcomes">{job.highlights.map(item=><span>{item}</span>)}</div>
        {job.engagements
          ? <div class="client-engagements">
              {job.engagements.map(engagement=><section class="client-engagement" aria-label={`Client project: ${engagement.client}`}>
                <div class="client-heading"><span class="client-label">Client engagement</span><h4>{engagement.client}</h4>{engagement.previous && <span class="client-previous">({engagement.previous})</span>}<span class="client-sector">{engagement.sector}</span></div>
                <ul class="achievements">{engagement.bullets.map(bullet=><li>{bullet}</li>)}</ul>
              </section>)}
            </div>
          : <ul class="achievements">{job.bullets.map(bullet=><li>{bullet}</li>)}</ul>}
      </div>
    </article>)}
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="skills">
  <div class="section-row">
    <span class="eyebrow">02 / Tools I use</span>
    <div class="story-small">
      <h2>Tools change. The work keeps me curious.</h2>
      <p>These are some of the tools and techniques from my recent work. The detailed list is here for anyone who wants it.</p>
      <div class="skill-lines">
        <p><strong>Programming</strong> Python · SQL</p>
        <p><strong>Data engineering</strong> Snowflake · SQL Server · Azure Fabric · ETL pipelines</p>
        <p><strong>Machine learning</strong> Time series forecasting · NLP · Sentiment analysis</p>
        <p><strong>AI</strong> LLMs · Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) · Generative AI · AI-DLC · AI-assisted development</p>
        <p><strong>Visualization</strong> Tableau · Power BI · Qlik Sense</p>
        <p><strong>Cloud</strong> AWS · Azure</p>
      </div>
      <h3 class="subheading">Certifications</h3>
      <p class="credentials">AWS Certified AI Practitioner · AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner · AI Agents on Databricks · Tableau Desktop Specialist · Microsoft Power BI Data Analyst (PL-300)</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="education">
  <div class="section-row">
    <span class="eyebrow">03 / Education</span>
    <div class="education-list">
      <div><h2>Where I studied.</h2></div>
      <div class="education-entry"><strong>M.S. in Big Data Analytics</strong><span>San Diego State University · May 2023</span><p>Enterprise Data Management, Big Data Analytics, Global Supply Chain Analytics, Computational Linguistics, and Machine Learning Engineering.</p></div>
      <div class="education-entry"><strong>Bachelor's in Computer Engineering</strong><span>Savitribai Phule Pune University · May 2016</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="section-row">
    <span class="eyebrow">04 / Elsewhere</span>
    <div><h2>More than fits on this page.</h2><p>Across six industries, I've delivered 200+ BI dashboards in 12 analytics initiatives. Some of the individual stories are on the Projects page.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/projects/">See selected projects ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href="/contact/">Get in touch ↗</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.accent{color:#4e5b6c}
.timeline{margin-top:42px;border-top:1px solid #dfe7f0}
.role-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(165px,.28fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(24px,5vw,80px);padding:clamp(30px,4vw,57px) 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe7f0}
.role-side{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px}
.role-index{font:800 1.4rem Manrope,sans-serif;color:#4e5b6c;letter-spacing:-.05em}
.role-date{font-size:.95rem;font-weight:800;color:#243750;margin-top:9px}
.role-location{font-size:.9rem;color:#7b889c}
.role-detail{max-width:1050px;min-width:0}
.role-detail h3{font-size:clamp(1.45rem,2.5vw,2.15rem);line-height:1.24;margin:14px 0 5px}
.company-brand{font-size:.92rem;color:#6b7990;font-weight:600}
.role-title{margin:8px 0 18px;color:#253852;font-size:1rem;font-weight:800}
.outcomes{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin:18px 0 23px}
.outcomes span{border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #d4d6d5;background:transparent;color:#4c5968;padding:5px 0;border-radius:0;font-weight:700;font-size:.8rem}
.achievements{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:13px}
.achievements li{position:relative;padding-left:22px;color:#56677d;font-size:.98rem;line-height:1.75}
.achievements li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:2px;top:12px;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#7290dd}
.client-engagements{display:grid;gap:24px;margin-top:26px}
.client-engagement{border-left:2px solid #e2e9f6;padding-left:18px}
.client-heading{display:flex;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px 10px;margin:0 0 13px}
.client-label{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#71839e;font-weight:800;width:100%}
.client-heading h4{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:1.07rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.35;margin:0;color:#243750}
.client-previous{font-size:.83rem;color:#75849a}
.client-sector{font-size:.8rem;color:#7383a0;font-weight:650}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin-top:24px}
.chips span{padding:10px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e0e8f3;border-radius:999px;font-size:.86rem;color:#52647d;font-weight:700}
@media(max-width:800px){.role-card{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}.role-side{display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap}.role-date{margin-top:0}}
</style>

<style>

.accent{color:var(--sage);font-style:italic}
.timeline{border-top-color:var(--line);margin-top:40px}
.role-card{border-bottom-color:var(--line);grid-template-columns:minmax(155px,.27fr) minmax(0,1fr)}
.role-index{font:italic 2rem Georgia,serif;color:var(--clay);font-weight:400}
.role-date{color:var(--sage-deep)}
.role-location,.company-brand{color:#7b8075}
.role-detail h3{font:500 clamp(1.7rem,2.35vw,2.35rem)/1.18 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.05em}
.role-title{color:var(--sage);font-weight:700}
.outcomes span{border-bottom:1px solid #c5cfc1;color:#485e4e}
.achievements li{color:#5b655c}
.achievements li::before{background:var(--sage)}
.client-engagement{border-left-color:#b8c7b9}
.client-label{color:var(--clay)}
.client-heading h4{font-family:"DM Sans",sans-serif;color:var(--sage-deep)}
.client-sector,.client-previous{color:#7a8177}
.chips span{background:#f4f2e9;border-color:var(--line);color:#526554;border-radius:3px}

</style>

<style>
.skill-lines{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:28px}
.skill-lines p{margin:0;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.96rem;line-height:1.6}
.skill-lines strong{display:inline-block;color:var(--ink);min-width:175px;margin-right:16px}
.subheading{margin-top:37px!important}
.credentials{max-width:820px}
.education-list{display:grid;gap:22px}
.education-entry{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:20px}
.education-entry strong{font-size:1.08rem;font-weight:700}
.education-entry span{display:block;color:var(--sage);font-size:.9rem;margin-top:6px}
.education-entry p{font-size:.94rem;margin:10px 0 0}
@media(max-width:620px){.skill-lines strong{display:block;margin:0 0 4px}}
</style>
